---
description: Testing and documentation expectations
alwaysApply: true
---

- Add tests for every behavior change.
- Prefer deterministic local HTTP fixtures over public servers.
- Test normal behavior and failure behavior, including flaky-network simulations.
- Run Go formatting/vet/tests, frontend lint, and type checks as applicable.
- Update relevant docs and examples.
- Do not mark a milestone complete unless its exit criteria are met.
